nts","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"q6hWVlVeiCgMgM22wt1wfw","review_id":"xZ3mYKFHAYIiyRiVTtdd1w","date":"2013-07-02T16:19:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9501471519470215,"text_excerpt":"Tied for the best burger I've had. I love the mayo bar and the onion rings are the best I've had. I've heard the tots and sweet potato fries were awesome too. Love the buns, the pickles and the meat! Good job!"},{"business_id":"q6hWVlVeiCgMgM22wt1wfw","review_id":"9lsi_gmeKcUSKzpUF_iEdg","date":"2011-08-29T15:51:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9492058157920837,"text_excerpt":"I seriously love this place. I had the Company Burger and it was sooooo taste. The cheese, the bread, the everything; I really loved it. The fries were huge, which if a great thing for me and I was able to enjoy my first Red Creme Soda in a long time. Its wonderful. The lamb burger looked phenomenal and I also need that in my life shortly. Cool place, kinda small and tables are hard to come by but don't let that stop you from getting a burger. If you are looking for hardcore service this is not the place for you, they are busy making burgers bus your own tables people, which is cool by me."},{"business_id":"q6hWVlVeiCgMgM22wt1wfw","review_id":"K7dDQBVup6qtiezphR7tJQ","date":"2012-02-24T02:30:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.948577880859375,"text_excerpt":"I've been here a few times since they opened...mainly because it's in my neighborhood, but it IS damn good and I've been meaning to review it. All my orders are to-go, and the wait times vary, but I have gotten in and out pretty quickly. They close for two hours every day in between lunch and dinner (3pm-5pm, I believe) so you gotta catch them at the right time. The guy who runs it is really nice, he's talked to me a few times from over the counter. It's a really nice layout. I usually only get the single because the burgers are pretty big...but on my most recent trip I decided it was only fair to get their signature burger (a double cheeseburger) which really wasn't as unwieldy as I expe..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"q6hWVlVeiCgMgM22wt1wfw","photo_id":"QJUv_TaDTP-gutrpGdwh7Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QJUv_TaDTP-gutrpGdwh7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8578034043312073},{"business_id":"q6hWVlVeiCgMgM22wt1wfw","photo_id":"RJtCaTjFUvcvTQfqHtsF_A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/RJtCaTjFUvcvTQfqHtsF_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8573020100593567},{"business_id":"q6hWVlVeiCgMgM22wt1wfw","photo_id":"7EsyzVSNwK1P6FFKuXd7Og","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7EsyzVSNwK1P6FFKuXd7Og.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8189964294433594},{"business_id":"q6hWVlVeiCgMgM22wt1wfw","photo_id":"gsvtG6p3Od9BLx62lNpA_g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gsvtG6p3Od9BLx62lNpA_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7816804051399231},{"business_id":"q6hWVlVeiCgMgM22wt1wfw","photo_id":"10id3N6p4XpL2tRt_94cHg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/10id3N6p4XpL2tRt_94cHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7778929471969604}]},"notebook_case":null}
